.Dd February 27, 2026
.Dt IR-VERIFIER 1
.Os Substrate
.Sh NAME
.Nm ir-verifier
.Nd verify textual SSA IR module correctness
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Ar input.ir
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
parses a textual IR module and runs structural/type verification.
It reports parse/verify diagnostics with line numbers.
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Bl -tag -width 2
.It 0
IR parsed and verified successfully.
.It 1
Parse or verification failure.
.It 2
Invalid command usage.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr ir-normalize 1 ,
.Xr ir-diff 1 ,
.Xr cc 1
